Z||000000||My7Fieros||04-30-2001||09:08 PM||||Well I wish I had some <I>before</I> pics, but I dont, but I do have the afters, and thats what counts. <BR>86 GT 5 spd, originaly white w/ grey ground effects. Paint was looking bad, so my friend and I took it into our "shop" (basically his brothers garage), fired up the compressor, and went to work! The color is "frost white", and believe me, these pics dont do it justice! Its <I>white</I>! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-008s_1.jpg"> The wheels are Motegis...17s up front and 18s in the back. The tires are Kumhos..215/40/17 in the front and 225/35/18 in the back. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-009s_2.jpg[/img][img]http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-010s_3.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-036s.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-018s_2.jpg"> <BR>||||reg||10
