Z||000030||JSocha||05-02-2001||10:57 AM||||<B>B - U - T - FULL!</B><P>The Pioneer stereo you have in there, as I have also noticed several other members with the same Pioneer, I have been considering that full DIN and a half size Pioneer for my GM (and Dodge) opening and I was wondering how the performance of that CD stereo from Pioneer is.  Anybody recommend something other that have experience with that specific Pioneer model?  Likes; dislikes?<P>What combination of 4x10 and 4x6 speakers are you guys using, wattage, etc.  Also been considering other then the Pioneer full size CD player one of the oversized Alpine models available that Alpine makes to fit in my GM and Dodge openings (including a DVD and Navigator unit).<P>Anybody use the 4x10 foam inserts to redirect the base and seal them from dust and moisture?  How's the performance with those?<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jnjsochasig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
